  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OFD-program Strengthening the Management of the Petroleum sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New phase Oil for Development Programme. Continued support to technical assistance for the management of the petroleum sector in Mozambique, based on Norway&#x2019;s experience.The Programme consists of four components; 1) The Resource Management Component, 2) the Safety Management Component, 3) the Environmental Component and 4) the Revenue Management Component.</narrative>
  </description>
